<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11274" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάλαλκε</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[πᾰ</span>], 3sg.
		aor. 2, opt. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαλάλκοι</span>:
		(with no pres., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλαλκε</span>
			 and cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαλέξω</span>):—<i>ward off, keep off</i>
			something <i>from</i> one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.348
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.766
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					8.85
				</span></i>
			: later inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαλαλκέμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					28.20
				</span></i>
			: 2sg.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάλαλκες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					5.215
				</span></i>
			.</div>
